  "2026-11-06T05:59:38.397Z",codex-sol,"Issue 149 targeted native regression passed 4/4. The original minimum (3062 trackers per task, 12248 meta/audit tasks plus development) archives and replays successfully in a real non-git SDK tracker: 73 shards, 5412-byte root, maximum record 264191 bytes, all below the unchanged 1048576-byte limit. Its synthetic favorable paired comparison also passes the explicit transfer plan and replays. Missing, extra, duplicated, reordered and altered shards refuse; oversize entries refuse before native writes. Prospective effect/alpha/power and generation-derived looks are now native plan context, with legacy version-one replay retained."
