  "2026-11-06T12:53:49.829Z",codex-agent,"Owned review round 3 completed on b89e5d5 with two valid findings and no outside-diff section: make the two-look 3,062-tracker figure explicit and distinguish the shipped three-look configuration (PRRT_kwDOTqJmqs60goPV); reject malformed decoded diagnostic receipt structures with diagnostic_receipt_shape before nested dereferences (PRRT_kwDOTqJmqs60goPa). Add focused documentation and real-SDK receipt regressions with behavioral revert proofs; retain all corpus and statistical identities."
  "2026-11-06T13:06:20.373Z",codex-agent,"Owned round 3 fixes validated: README, architecture and transfer docs explicitly distinguish the original two-look requirement (3,062 independent trackers per task at each look) from the shipped three-look requirement (3,218), with a 2-to-5-look table. The factory-derived documentation test checks both declarations. Diagnostic receipt decoding now uses bounded JSON and validates required nested manifest, archive, task-id and paired-evaluation structures before source access or scratch writes; existing digest/design checks and historical receipts remain supported. The real-SDK regression refuses 27 self-consistently hashed malformed shapes in both direct and CLI replay paths, with no output directory or tracker changes. Two focused tests, six restored regression checks, the new PM-linked test and both packed historical receipt replays pass. node test/fixtures/transfer-reverts.ts owned-review-round-three passes four expected behavioral failures: remove the two-look context in each of three docs, or remove the decoded shape guard. Production/test typecheck, lint, zero duplicates and 562 documented declarations pass. Existing corpus-scale follow-up now records the aggregate 12,872-meta-task requirement versus the unchanged 10,000-task compartment limit; the shipped historical-MDE configuration is diagnostic under those bounds. No statistical or capacity threshold was weakened and no SDK gap was found. Next fix push will be queued for owned review round 4 immediately."
